    "meaning": "names, household numbers, boarder names, amounts and frequencies confirmed against the printed form and the live labels; the property address source is a material business decision.",
    "openQuestions": [
      "RSFA-DECISION-1: which address is the 'property' on boarder declarations: legacy = applicant 1 physical address, printed as Street / Province / Country (Suburb and City never printed); proposal ASB-ADDR-1..4 = 1st Property Address Street / Suburb / City / Postcode (preview PDF provided). Either way the parts come from Make's OpenAI address split (module 26), which is not deterministic.",
      "RSFA-DECISION-2: pre-fill the customer's signature dates with today: legacy pre-fills both signature dates with today (DDMMYYYY, format inferred from the 8-cell comb); proposal = leave them blank.",
      "The template is owner-encrypted by ASB and filled with an incremental save keeping ASB's encryption (D-007)."
